+    <h3>礼物</h3>{self.giftHistory.length?self.giftHistory.map(g=><div className="lobby-row" key={g.id}><span>{g.fromName} · {cosmeticById(g.cosmeticId)?.name} · {g.claimedAt?'已收下':'待领取'}</span><button disabled={readOnly} onClick={()=>setGift(g)}>查看礼函</button></div>):<p className="lobby-hint">还没有赠礼记录；转盘奖品在对对碰奖品箱领取。</p>}
